A container whose table ends on a joined header row

```
- |=a |
  + b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">a b</th></tr></thead>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- | a |
  + |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> |=a |
> + b |
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">a b</th></tr></thead>
  </table>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```
